// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  LATTICE — a network graph explorer as a Garden Petal panel.
//
//  Fifty-nine services of a fictional storefront and the calls between them, laid
//  out by a force simulation that runs inside the script: every node repels
//  every other, every call is a spring, and a weak gravity keeps the whole
//  thing on the table. The camera zooms about the pointer and pans by drag;
//  selecting a node lights up its neighbourhood, its blast radius, or
//  everything it depends on.
//
//  Designed for a 1440x900 viewport. See README.md.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

let TAU = 6.28318530718

